title: 'Registrar: receive migrated paras'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      `pallet-registrar-para` implements `ReceiveMigratedParas`, recreating paras from the relay
      chain's `paras_registrar` with deposits at this chain's prices. A manager who cannot pay
      keeps the para without a deposit, so no para is dropped.

      `pallet-registrar-relay` adds `note_migrated_awaiting_first_head`, which the migration must
      call for paras without a head yet, so they still get locked on their first head.

      `ReceiveMigratedParas` gains `weight_of_receive_para` and
      `weight_of_receive_next_free_para_id`, and both pallets' `WeightInfo` gain the matching fns.

crates:
  - name: registrar-primitives
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-para
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-relay
    bump: major
